  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Roll out the keto-friendly pastry to a thickness of 1/8 inch.",
    "Mix together feta cheese, kalamata olives, sun-dried tomatoes, fresh chives, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Place the cheese mixture onto one half of the pastry, leaving a 1/2 inch border around the edges.",
    "Brush the edges with a little water, then fold the other half of the pastry over the filling.",
    "Press the edges to seal, using a fork to crimp.",
